    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ca87483c747788ea8e272e500ca346b0.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spring has not come to the naturally blessed island of Esidesi! Two fairies noticed this anomaly and set out on an adventure to bring spring to the people of the village. In order to bring back spring, they must pass through dangerous places. Choose between \u201cPETTY,\u201d who loves spring, and \u201cKABURA,\u201d a boy fairy who doesn't really like spring but loves PETTY, and proceed with your attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/d68d6bda6844b4694f472e0227e8c1c4.avif?t=1747133691\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the usual shots, make use of three types of weapon items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also items available to strengthen the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the best combination of items for each stage and boss to conquer them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esideci, but the two protagonists are faced with a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esidesi, but the two heroes are confronted by enemies who attack in a variety of ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PETTY (STANDARD)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/c3409c855b0e0950c781f0ce8bbdf1cc.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ea9d0f017b0996470c5fb0a640a787f5.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fly Butterfly, which tracks the player's movements, has the added ability of a weapon item. The character has very high attack power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KABURA (SIMPLE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/358860a361e1221bc4fef9124efe39e6.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ad80e292b64484e9831bd2543341280b.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A powerful character with a fly butterfly that circles around the player and a weapon item that can be used infinitely once acquired. Simple and easy to use!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/5a98fea3983dd52e907173081cdddc38.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cocobat Missile</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires missiles up and down. Particularly effective against enemies on the ceiling or ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ab26f1ae35e7d3647f3d35bb1e2cea9e.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solar Laser</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This weapon goes straight and deals high damage. Perfect for hard enemies and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/a13eb8d4501f28451326fc2b48d1e833.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nut Blade</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can attack forward and backward. Ideal for enemies approaching from behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enhanced Item</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/00e9952a2638b5e6dc5c7653041ca4e2.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly Butterfly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An invincible support character with no ground or collision detection. Movement changes depending on the player character selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/280171c495171adb400e144e5e2b22b7.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vivaldi Barrier</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A barrier is deployed to protect the player from enemy bullets, but it disappears when the player is hit by many bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/bf5b0aee8307545eba1f09f1bbe97b90.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's movement will become faster, but if you take more than 4, you will be the slowest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two player characters \u201cPETTY\u201d and \u201cKABURA\u201d can be chosen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable, fantastical, pop, and slightly strange world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guidelines for Distribution and Video Submission </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to make play videos and distribution for commercial or non-commercial purposes. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is not a problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ca87483c747788ea8e272e500ca346b0.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spring has not come to the naturally blessed island of Esidesi! Two fairies noticed this anomaly and set out on an adventure to bring spring to the people of the village. In order to bring back spring, they must pass through dangerous places. Choose between \u201cPETTY,\u201d who loves spring, and \u201cKABURA,\u201d a boy fairy who doesn't really like spring but loves PETTY, and proceed with your attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/d68d6bda6844b4694f472e0227e8c1c4.avif?t=1747133691\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to the usual shots, make use of three types of weapon items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also items available to strengthen the player!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the best combination of items for each stage and boss to conquer them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esideci, but the two protagonists are faced with a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage is set on the nature-rich island of Esidesi, but the two heroes are confronted by enemies who attack in a variety of ways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PETTY (STANDARD)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/c3409c855b0e0950c781f0ce8bbdf1cc.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ea9d0f017b0996470c5fb0a640a787f5.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fly Butterfly, which tracks the player's movements, has the added ability of a weapon item. The character has very high attack power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KABURA (SIMPLE)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/358860a361e1221bc4fef9124efe39e6.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ad80e292b64484e9831bd2543341280b.avif?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A powerful character with a fly butterfly that circles around the player and a weapon item that can be used infinitely once acquired. Simple and easy to use!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapon Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/5a98fea3983dd52e907173081cdddc38.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cocobat Missile</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fires missiles up and down. Particularly effective against enemies on the ceiling or ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/ab26f1ae35e7d3647f3d35bb1e2cea9e.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solar Laser</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This weapon goes straight and deals high damage. Perfect for hard enemies and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/a13eb8d4501f28451326fc2b48d1e833.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nut Blade</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can attack forward and backward. Ideal for enemies approaching from behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enhanced Item</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/00e9952a2638b5e6dc5c7653041ca4e2.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly Butterfly</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An invincible support character with no ground or collision detection. Movement changes depending on the player character selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/280171c495171adb400e144e5e2b22b7.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vivaldi Barrier</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A barrier is deployed to protect the player from enemy bullets, but it disappears when the player is hit by many bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1309680/extras/bf5b0aee8307545eba1f09f1bbe97b90.webp?t=1747133691\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed Up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player's movement will become faster, but if you take more than 4, you will be the slowest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two player characters \u201cPETTY\u201d and \u201cKABURA\u201d can be chosen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable, fantastical, pop, and slightly strange world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjustable difficulty level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Guidelines for Distribution and Video Submission </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to make play videos and distribution for commercial or non-commercial purposes. Monetization on platforms such as YouTube and Twitch is not a problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
